Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Main Biexciton State - Production Plots", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"5fa8021f-f02f-7b4b-902c-f5c67604fdc7"],

Cell["\<\
Dedicated plotting notebook for the ground exciton X00 and the main biexciton \
XX0000. It reads the completed seven-geometry refined summary and produces:\
\[LineSeparator](1) E_XX versus c at a = 5 and versus a at c = 1; \
\[LineSeparator](2) E_bind = 2 E_X - E_XX along the same scans; and \
\[LineSeparator](3) the radiative lifetimes tau_X and tau_XX. \
\[LineSeparator]Lifetimes follow Eqs. (23)-(25) of Hayrapetyan et al., \
Physica E 105 (2019) 47-55. The production energies exclude the band gap, so \
E_exc = E_g + E_X is used in the lifetime formula. Error bars are rough \
first-order propagation of the stored numerical-integration error estimates.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9943966057273273`*^9, 
  3.9943966330058117`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"28729612-97e5-3f4e-8a76-\
6214c2538ba3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Load completed production data", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4010ab93-41a5-1e4e-983f-e49ec3aa1b70"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

